dentity to find $2{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta :$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta  & =1 \\\\ {cos}^{2}⁡\\theta  & =1-{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta  \\\\ 2{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta  & =2-2{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting $sin⁡\\theta =\\frac{\\sqrt{17}}{7}$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta  & =2-2{\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{17}}{7}\\right)}^{2} \\\\  & =2-2\\left(\\frac{17}{49}\\right) \\\\  & =2-\\frac{34}{49} \\\\  & =\\frac{64}{49}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo our final answer is $2{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta =\\frac{64}{49}.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186511705 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "037cbbc0-15eb-5ca5-9687-929e9c03c3b6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{10}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186511681} {:answer/id #uuid "5524e754-213c-5297-b6c8-38ca120bb015" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186511692} {:answer/id #uuid "8dc4b2b4-ef85-5136-ae4f-475a2d6e7ccc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186511698} {:answer/id #uuid "8e1ea995-d6ac-507a-b61c-f3087c637df3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{5}{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186511699} {:answer/id #uuid "fd2e1cc1-cb15-5e19-b2ed-06cfc90ef286" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{5}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186511714}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fd2e1cc1-cb15-5e19-b2ed-06cfc90ef286" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{5}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186511714} :answer-field/id #uuid "1aa6be0a-2bd9-5771-ae42-ec9c7d256501" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 175921865